      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "The Incubator is a general production machine that serves two purposes:\n\n1. Hatching (modified) Larvae into drones at the end of the whole process.\n2. Heating items and liquids to produce different resources you will need in different parts of the entire research and modification process.\n\nThere are up to five different resources you can create from Incubators:\n\n1. Liquid Growth Medium: Water + Growth Medium\n2. Bacteria: Liquid Growth Medium + Wheat OR more Bacteria + Growth Medium\n3. Enzyme: Bacteria + Sugar\n4. Bacteria Vector: Bacteria + Blaze Powder OR more Bacteria Vector + Growth Medium\n5. Polymerizing Bacteria: Bacteria + Bone Meal OR more Polymerizing Bacteria + Growth Medium\n\nThree of the recipes can optionally be extended by injecting them with more Growth Medium instead of using a different ingredient. If you\u0027re able to produce a bunch of Growth Medium, consider \"priming\" incubators for these outputs and then switching them to use Growth Medium indefinitely in a feedback loop.\n\nEnzyme is usually produced in a pipeline from Bacteria, which is in turn produced from Liquid Growth Medium.\n\nBacteria Vector is only used by the Inoculator to modify Larvae, and you don\u0027t need it if you use a Splicer instead.\n\nPS: You\u0027ll also need a source for Ethanol for the Genepool and the Isolator. This technology line has a drinking problem.\n\nPPS: Blaze Powder also comes up with at least Fluorescent Dye later.",
