      "desc:8": "Sometimes, basic automation isn\u0027t enough. We\u0027ve heard you - we are now offering the §5§nAdvanced Routing Package§r to allow more complex automation of your components!\n\nThe Nanopart Splitter allows splitting, merging and filtering of your components between different colored VCI and VCO hatches. In the configuration GUI, you can define rules such as:\n- Merging any colors of your choice into one color\n- Evenly splitting inputs from one color into many output colors\n- Filtering specific components from one color to another\nand many more!\n\nWe have expanded the functionality of Nanopart Splitter rules with feedback from our customers to also include ease-of-use features such as:\n- Middle clicking item filters to set them to a custom rename\n- Wildcard input color if no input color is selected\n- Even distribution to output colors if multiple output colors are selected\n- Filtering items using their normal form rather than requiring the component wrapped form\n\nAdditionally, if you purchase the Premium Package, you gain access to the Nanochip Redstone Input hatch, allowing for fine-grained redstone control of your routing. Each redstone hatch has a \"channel\" setting, which can then be configured in a rule for it to use that specific hatch\u0027s redstone signal. The hatch can also be used on some other modules, like the Board module (sold separately).",
